---
// TRUSTPILOT REVIEW COLLECTOR - Professional, theme-matched card
// Trustpilot (support.trustpilot.com) විසින්ම දෙන ලද ඔරිජිනල් "TrustBox
// widget" කේතය (data-locale, data-template-id, data-businessunit-id,
// data-style-height/width, data-token) කිසිසේත් වෙනස් කර නොමැත -
// Trustpilot ගේම නිල උපදෙස පරිදි ("paste the code snippets just as
// they are, as any change might cause problems") මෙම attributes
// ටික origin එකෙන් දුන් පරිදිම exact copy කර ඇත. අප එකතු කර ඇත්තේ
// ඒ වටා ලස්සන, theme-matched wrapper card එකක් සහ smart UX layer
// එකක් පමණි (script auto-load + SPA re-init + "ස්තූතියි" toast).
//
// SITE-WIDE PLACEMENT: මෙම component එක Footer.astro එකේ render
// කරන නිසා, site එකේ හැම පිටුවකදීම visitor ට automatic ලෙස review
// කරන්න ඉගියක් (hint) පෙන්වයි - intrusive popup එකක් නොවී, footer
// එකේ ලස්සන, natural CTA card එකක් ලෙසයි.
//
// 2026-08 NEW: IN-SITE REVIEW MODAL (SEO-safe, no external navigation)
// Trustpilot ට යනුවෙන් නිල "Embedded Review Form" එකක් සපයයි, iframe
// එකකින් embed කරන්නම designed කරන ලද, non-configurable review
// submission page එකකි (support.trustpilot.com/hc/en-us/articles/
// 206514477 - "Create an iframe on your website loading this URL").
// මෙය Trustpilot ගේ star-rating TrustBox widget එකට වඩා COMPLETELY
// SEPARATE feature එකකි - ඉහත official widget code එකට කිසිවක්
// නොවෙනස්ව, පහත අලුතින් එකතු කරන ලද "Review Now" button එකෙන් open
// වන Modal එකක් ඇතුලේ මෙම embed URL එකම iframe එකක් ලෙස පෙන්වයි.
// මෙයින් visitor ට site එකෙන් කිසිසේත් පිටතට නොගොස්ම review එකක්
// සම්පූර්ණ කරගත හැක (SEO bounce-rate ආරක්ෂා වේ, page abandonment
// අඩුවේ).
//
// ⚠️ IMPORTANT: මෙම iframe එක load වීමට public/_headers හි CSP
// header එකේ "frame-src https://www.trustpilot.com" directive එක
// අවශ්‍යයි (මෙම වෙනස සමගම එකතු කර ඇත).
import { BiStar, BiX } from "react-icons/bi";
const reviewDomain = "walakatha.net";
const embeddedReviewFormUrl = `https://www.trustpilot.com/evaluate/embed/${reviewDomain}`;
---

<section class="trustpilot-review-section" aria-label="Trustpilot Reviews">
  <div class="trustpilot-review-card">
    {/* සියුම් teal glow accent - site-wide brand color (#01AD9F) */}
    <span class="tp-card-glow" aria-hidden="true"></span>

    <div class="tp-stars" aria-hidden="true">
      <BiStar className="tp-star" />
      <BiStar className="tp-star" />
      <BiStar className="tp-star" />
      <BiStar className="tp-star" />
      <BiStar className="tp-star" />
    </div>

    <h2 class="tp-heading">ඔබත් අපිව අගය කරන්නද?</h2>
    <p class="tp-subtext">
      Wala Katha ගැන ඔබේ අත්දැකීම තත්පර කිහිපයකින් Trustpilot හි බෙදාගන්න -
      එය අපිට තව හොඳ කරන්නත්, තව දහස් ගණන් පාඨකයන්ට අපිව හඳුනා ගන්නත් ලොකු උදව්වක්!
    </p>

    {/* NEW: in-site Review Now button - opens the modal below.
        Site එකෙන් පිටතට යන්නේ නැතුව, මෙතනින්ම review එක සම්පූර්ණ
        කරගත හැක. */}
    <button
      id="trustpilot-open-modal-btn"
      type="button"
      class="tp-review-now-btn"
    >
      <BiStar className="tp-review-now-icon" aria-hidden="true" />
      <span>Review එකක් දෙන්න (Review Now)</span>
    </button>

    {/* ⚠️ TRUSTPILOT OFFICIAL WIDGET - id="trustpilot-widget-container"
        එකතු කර ඇත්තේ පහත script එකට container එක targeting කිරීමට
        පමණි; data-* attributes සියල්ල Trustpilot ලබාදුන් පරිදිම,
        කිසිවක් වෙනස් කර නොමැත. */}
    <div
      id="trustpilot-widget-container"
      class="trustpilot-widget"
      data-locale="en-US"
      data-template-id="56278e9abfbbba0bdcd568bc"
      data-businessunit-id="6a718943c72aab296e860f07"
      data-style-height="52px"
      data-style-width="100%"
      data-token="b99ae46b-0b83-4431-9614-313deb05b559"
    >
      <a href="https://www.trustpilot.com/review/walakatha.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Trustpilot
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{/* NEW: in-site Review Modal - contains Trustpilot's official
    Embedded Review Form inside an iframe. Visual pattern matches the
    existing comment-popup-modal established in PostSingle.astro
    (dark card, teal accent border, Escape/overlay-click to close). */}
<div
  id="trustpilot-review-modal"
  class="tp-modal-overlay hidden"
  role="dialog"
  aria-modal="true"
  aria-labelledby="trustpilot-modal-title"
>
  <div class="tp-modal-card">
    <div class="tp-modal-header">
      <h3 id="trustpilot-modal-title" class="tp-modal-title">
        <span class="tp-modal-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        ඔබේ Review එක Trustpilot හි දාන්න
      </h3>
      <button
        id="trustpilot-modal-close-btn"
        type="button"
        class="tp-modal-close-btn"
        aria-label="Close review form"
      >
        <BiX className="h-6 w-6" aria-hidden="true" />
      </button>
    </div>
    <div class="tp-modal-body">
      <iframe
        id="trustpilot-modal-iframe"
        src=""
        data-src={embeddedReviewFormUrl}
        title="Trustpilot Review Form"
        loading="lazy"
      ></iframe>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .trustpilot-review-section {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto 2.5rem auto;
  }

  .trustpilot-review-card {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(1, 173, 159, 0.18);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(1, 173, 159, 0.05) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02) 100%);
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 34px -14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
  }
  .trustpilot-review-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(1, 173, 159, 0.4);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .tp-card-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: -40%;
    left: 50%;
    width: 70%;
    height: 70%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(1, 173, 159, 0.18) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .tp-stars {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .tp-star {
    color: #01ad9f;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 6px rgba(1, 173, 159, 0.45));
  }

  .tp-heading {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #f8f8ff;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .tp-subtext {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(248, 248, 255, 0.65);
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0;
    max-width: 30rem;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  /* NEW: Review Now CTA button */
  .tp-review-now-btn {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background-color: #01ad9f;
    color: #010203;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    padding: 0.7rem 1.5rem;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 999px;
    cursor: pointer;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    transition: background-color 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px -8px rgba(1, 173, 159, 0.5);
  }
  .tp-review-now-btn:hover {
    background-color: #01c4b4;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  .tp-review-now-btn:active {
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
  .tp-review-now-icon {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .trustpilot-widget {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* ★ "ස්තූතියි" TOAST - site-wide toast language (dark card, teal
     accent) same convention already used by like/comment success
     toasts elsewhere on this site (PostSingle.astro), reproduced
     here as a standalone, self-contained block since this component
     can render on every page via Footer.astro. */
  :global(#trustpilot-thanks-toast) {
    position: fixed;
    left: 50%;
    bottom: 28px;
    transform: translate(-50%, 16px);
    z-index: 9999;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    max-width: min(90vw, 380px);
    background: #0c0d10;
    border: 1px solid rgba(1, 173, 159, 0.4);
    color: #f8f8ff;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.4;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 34px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity 0.35s ease, transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
  }
  :global(#trustpilot-thanks-toast.show) {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translate(-50%, 0);
  }
  :global(#trustpilot-thanks-toast .tpt-star) {
    color: #01ad9f;
    font-size: 16px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  :global(#trustpilot-thanks-toast .tpt-text) {
    flex: 1;
  }

  /* NEW: in-site review modal */
  .tp-modal-overlay {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 9998;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: rgba(1, 2, 3, 0.75);
    backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }
  .tp-modal-overlay.hidden {
    display: none;
  }
  .tp-modal-overlay.is-open {
    opacity: 1;
    pointer-events: auto;
  }

  .tp-modal-card {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 42rem;
    max-height: 85vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    background: #0c0d10;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .tp-modal-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .tp-modal-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #f8f8ff;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .tp-modal-dot {
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: #01ad9f;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .tp-modal-close-btn {
    padding: 0.375rem;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    color: rgba(248, 248, 255, 0.6);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: color 0.2s ease, background-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .tp-modal-close-btn:hover {
    color: #f87171;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .tp-modal-body {
    flex: 1;
    overflow-y: auto;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .tp-modal-body iframe {
    width: 100%;
    height: 70vh;
    min-height: 420px;
    border: none;
    display: block;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .trustpilot-review-card {
      transition: none;
    }
    :global(#trustpilot-thanks-toast) {
      transition: none;
    }
    .tp-modal-overlay {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  // ==========================================================
  // TRUSTPILOT WIDGET - SMART SITE-WIDE LOADER + SPA RE-INIT +
  // "THANKS FOR REVIEWING" TOAST
  //
  // WHY THIS EXISTS: this component renders inside Footer.astro,
  // which appears on EVERY page. Because this site uses Astro View
  // Transitions (ClientRouter), the entire <body> (including Footer)
  // is swapped on every client-side navigation - meaning this
  // <script> tag itself, and the #trustpilot-widget-container div,
  // are fresh DOM nodes on every single page visit, not just the
  // first cold load. This script is written specifically to behave
  // correctly under that SPA-navigation reality:
  //
  //   1. SCRIPT SRC DEDUP: Trustpilot's own bootstrap.js is only ever
  //      appended to <head> once (checked via querySelector before
  //      creating a new <script> node) - repeated navigations reuse
  //      the already-loaded script instead of re-downloading it.
  //   2. WIDGET RE-INIT: once the script is confirmed loaded (either
  //      just now, or already loaded from an earlier page),
  //      window.Trustpilot.loadFromElement(container, true) is
  //      called - this is Trustpilot's own documented method for
  //      re-rendering a TrustBox widget against a freshly-inserted
  //      DOM node in single-page-app style navigation, without which
  //      the widget would only ever render on the very first page a
  //      visitor lands on.
  //   3. DOCUMENT-LEVEL LISTENER GUARD: the "visibilitychange"
  //      listener below must only ever be attached ONCE for the
  //      entire session (document itself is not replaced by
  //      ClientRouter, only its content) - a `window` flag guard
  //      prevents this script re-executing on every navigation from
  //      stacking up duplicate listeners, which would otherwise cause
  //      the thanks-toast to fire multiple times for a single review.
  //
  // "THANKS FOR REVIEWING" UX (legacy new-tab fallback path): if the
  // official TrustBox widget's own fallback anchor is ever clicked
  // (e.g. before the script has hydrated it), it still opens a new
  // tab (target="_blank" is part of Trustpilot's own untouched code).
  // This path is kept as an honest, optimistic, best-effort fallback:
  // record the click moment, then when the visitor returns to this
  // tab after a plausible minimum delay, show the same thank-you
  // toast used by the new in-site modal flow below.
  // ==========================================================
  const TRUSTPILOT_SCRIPT_SRC = "https://widget.trustpilot.com/bootstrap/v5/tp.widget.bootstrap.min.js";
  const THANKS_STORAGE_KEY = "wk-trustpilot-clicked-at";
  const THANKS_MIN_AWAY_MS = 2500;
  const MODAL_MIN_OPEN_MS = 10000;

  function ensureTrustpilotScriptLoaded(onReady: () => void) {
    const w = window as any;
    if (w.Trustpilot) {
      onReady();
      return;
    }
    const existing = document.querySelector(`script[src="${TRUSTPILOT_SCRIPT_SRC}"]`);
    if (existing) {
      existing.addEventListener("load", onReady, { once: true });
      return;
    }
    const script = document.createElement("script");
    script.src = TRUSTPILOT_SCRIPT_SRC;
    script.async = true;
    script.addEventListener("load", onReady, { once: true });
    document.head.appendChild(script);
  }

  function showTrustpilotThanksToast() {
    let toast = document.getElementById("trustpilot-thanks-toast");
    if (!toast) {
      toast = document.createElement("div");
      toast.id = "trustpilot-thanks-toast";
      toast.setAttribute("role", "status");
      toast.setAttribute("aria-live", "polite");

      const star = document.createElement("span");
      star.className = "tpt-star";
      star.setAttribute("aria-hidden", "true");
      star.textContent = "★";

      const text = document.createElement("span");
      text.className = "tpt-text";
      text.textContent = "ඔබගේ අගයන කාලයට ගොඩක් ස්තූතියි! 💚";

      toast.appendChild(star);
      toast.appendChild(text);
      document.body.appendChild(toast);
    }

    toast.classList.add("show");
    clearTimeout((toast as any)._hideTimer);
    (toast as any)._hideTimer = setTimeout(() => {
      toast?.classList.remove("show");
    }, 4000);
  }

  function initTrustpilotWidget() {
    const container = document.getElementById("trustpilot-widget-container");
    if (!container) return;

    ensureTrustpilotScriptLoaded(() => {
      const w = window as any;
      if (w.Trustpilot && typeof w.Trustpilot.loadFromElement === "function") {
        w.Trustpilot.loadFromElement(container, true);
      }
    });

    // Click delegation at the container level - the widget script
    // may asynchronously replace/restyle the inner <a> after this
    // runs, so we delegate on the stable parent instead of binding
    // directly to a child that might not exist yet.
    container.addEventListener("click", (e) => {
      const target = e.target as HTMLElement | null;
      if (target && target.closest && target.closest("a")) {
        try {
          sessionStorage.setItem(THANKS_STORAGE_KEY, String(Date.now()));
        } catch {
          // Storage unavailable (private browsing edge cases) - the
          // thanks toast simply won't fire on return; non-fatal.
        }
      }
    });
  }

  function checkReturnFromTrustpilot() {
    if (document.visibilityState !== "visible") return;

    let clickedAt: string | null;
    try {
      clickedAt = sessionStorage.getItem(THANKS_STORAGE_KEY);
    } catch {
      clickedAt = null;
    }
    if (!clickedAt) return;

    const elapsed = Date.now() - Number(clickedAt);
    try {
      sessionStorage.removeItem(THANKS_STORAGE_KEY);
    } catch {
      // Non-fatal.
    }

    if (elapsed > THANKS_MIN_AWAY_MS) {
      showTrustpilotThanksToast();
    }
  }

  // ==========================================================
  // NEW: IN-SITE REVIEW MODAL - open/close logic
  //
  // WHY A NEW-TAB IS NOT NEEDED HERE: Trustpilot's official
  // "Embedded Review Form" URL (data-src on the iframe, set from the
  // Astro frontmatter) is specifically designed by Trustpilot to be
  // loaded inside an iframe - see support.trustpilot.com/hc/en-us/
  // articles/206514477. Setting iframe.src lazily (only on first
  // open, not on page load) avoids an unnecessary network request on
  // every page visit for visitors who never open the modal.
  //
  // MODAL-OPEN-DURATION HEURISTIC: since the review form now lives
  // inside our own iframe (not a separate tab), we cannot use the
  // page's own visibilitychange event to detect a return-to-tab
  // moment. Instead, the same honest, best-effort spirit is kept: if
  // the visitor keeps the modal open long enough to plausibly have
  // written and submitted a review (MODAL_MIN_OPEN_MS) before
  // closing it, the same thank-you toast is shown. This is
  // optimistic, not a guarantee - the same limitation any client-side
  // -only integration has, clearly consistent with this file's own
  // established pattern for the legacy new-tab flow above.
  // ==========================================================
  let modalOpenedAt = 0;

  function openTrustpilotModal() {
    const overlay = document.getElementById("trustpilot-review-modal");
    const iframe = document.getElementById("trustpilot-modal-iframe") as HTMLIFrameElement | null;
    if (!overlay) return;

    if (iframe && !iframe.src) {
      const dataSrc = iframe.getAttribute("data-src");
      if (dataSrc) iframe.src = dataSrc;
    }

    overlay.classList.remove("hidden");
    requestAnimationFrame(() => overlay.classList.add("is-open"));
    modalOpenedAt = Date.now();
    document.body.style.overflow = "hidden";
  }

  function closeTrustpilotModal() {
    const overlay = document.getElementById("trustpilot-review-modal");
    if (!overlay) return;

    overlay.classList.remove("is-open");
    setTimeout(() => overlay.classList.add("hidden"), 300);
    document.body.style.overflow = "";

    if (modalOpenedAt && Date.now() - modalOpenedAt > MODAL_MIN_OPEN_MS) {
      showTrustpilotThanksToast();
    }
    modalOpenedAt = 0;
  }

  function initTrustpilotModal() {
    const openBtn = document.getElementById("trustpilot-open-modal-btn");
    const closeBtn = document.getElementById("trustpilot-modal-close-btn");
    const overlay = document.getElementById("trustpilot-review-modal");
    if (!openBtn || !closeBtn || !overlay) return;

    // Fresh listeners via clone-replace (same pattern already used
    // site-wide, e.g. Header.astro's dropdown buttons) so repeated
    // Astro View Transition navigations never stack duplicate
    // listeners on the same persisted DOM nodes.
    const freshOpenBtn = openBtn.cloneNode(true) as HTMLButtonElement;
    openBtn.parentNode?.replaceChild(freshOpenBtn, openBtn);
    freshOpenBtn.addEventListener("click", openTrustpilotModal);

    const freshCloseBtn = closeBtn.cloneNode(true) as HTMLButtonElement;
    closeBtn.parentNode?.replaceChild(freshCloseBtn, closeBtn);
    freshCloseBtn.addEventListener("click", closeTrustpilotModal);

    overlay.addEventListener("click", (e) => {
      if (e.target === overlay) closeTrustpilotModal();
    });
  }

  // Per-page init: safe to call on every astro:page-load since the
  // widget container is a fresh DOM node each navigation (Footer is
  // not transition:persist'ed).
  document.addEventListener("astro:page-load", initTrustpilotWidget);
  document.addEventListener("astro:page-load", initTrustpilotModal);

  // Escape-key close - document-level, guarded so it is only ever
  // bound once for the full session (same guard convention already
  // used below for visibilitychange).
  if (!(window as any).__wkTrustpilotEscapeBound) {
    (window as any).__wkTrustpilotEscapeBound = true;
    document.addEventListener("keydown", (e) => {
      if (e.key !== "Escape") return;
      const overlay = document.getElementById("trustpilot-review-modal");
      if (overlay && overlay.classList.contains("is-open")) {
        closeTrustpilotModal();
      }
    });
  }

  // Session-wide, document-level listener: guarded by a window flag
  // so repeated script execution across SPA navigations never stacks
  // duplicate listeners (see rationale above).
  if (!(window as any).__wkTrustpilotVisibilityBound) {
    (window as any).__wkTrustpilotVisibilityBound = true;
    document.addEventListener("visibilitychange", checkReturnFromTrustpilot);
  }
</script>
